guide - Visualizing of Graphs supporting GML- and GraphML-Format

requirements:
-the programm was tested on Linux SuSE 8.0/7.3-Systems but should work with other distributions as well
-xerces version 1.7.0 (1.6.0 might work too but you need to adjust include pathes in the source code)
-a GLU-library (e.g. MesaGlu)

building:
-set the correct paths to your installation of xerces in the Makefile
-type "make"

running:
-probably you have to adjust the environment variable LD_LIBRARY_PATH to include the xerces library 
(e.g. by "export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="/home/student/maagv/hiwi/xerces-c1_6_0-linux/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH")
-type "graph.tcl" or "wish graph.tcl" to set the parameters with an interface
-or start main directly setting the parameters "by hand"
the results are written in the file "erg.xml"
You may want to use the help provided by graph.tcl

bug reports, critics, and so on to maagv@fmi.uni-konstanz.de
